{% comment %}
  NC Gift banner fix (homepage only, via templates/index.json).
  The free gift band (.nc-gift-home, mounted by nc-gift.liquid) was repainted by
  nc-cro.liquid with an off-palette sage green gradient. This section moves it to
  the brand teal promo gradient, the same family as the trust strip and the Our
  promise band, with cream heading, seafoam eyebrow, and the standing 3D shadow.
  The gold animated pill from nc-cro is kept as the contrast accent.
  Wins the cascade over nc-cro's single-class !important rules by carrying the
  higher #nc-home specificity. Color-only change, so desktop and mobile both
  inherit it; all existing responsive geometry rules stay in force.
{% endcomment %}
<style>
#nc-home .nc-gift-home{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#3a8d83 0%,#2C6E72 42%,#173f44 100%) !important;border:none !important;box-shadow:0 16px 14px -14px rgba(15,42,51,.42),0 30px 26px -26px rgba(15,42,51,.45),0 44px 38px -38px rgba(15,42,51,.4) !important}
#nc-home .nc-gift-home__eb{color:#9CC9C4 !important}
#nc-home .nc-gift-home__t{color:#F3EEE1 !important}
#nc-home .nc-gift-home__s{color:rgba(243,238,225,.85) !important}
#nc-home .nc-gift-home__img{background:#F3EEE1 !important;box-shadow:0 16px 30px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.55) !important}
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name":"NC Gift Banner Fix","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
